# Options → "Stock Exchange ticker shows". Switches the LED boards to price and ₡ change, then
# to change %, logging today's entries in each mode and capturing the screen (point the camera
# at the Stock Exchange to see the boards). The player's choice is put back at the end.
name ticker shows: change % with a % sign, or price and ₡ change, with + / − signs
live-ticker on
ticker-shows price
expect-log ticker PriceAndChange: 
# the whole screen is redrawn in the new style at once (never a mix)
wait 1
expect-ticker-style
wait 25
capture ticker-price
ticker-shows percent
expect-log ticker ChangePercent: 
wait 1
expect-ticker-style
wait 25
capture ticker-percent
cleanup:
ticker-shows restore
